    <string name="gp_widget_effort_no_measure">ואין להם מדד, אז שום דבר כאן לא יכול לומר אם הם התקדמו.</string>
    <!-- NOT in the brief's list of nine, and the same §4.8 defect twice over:
         `%1$s` is a user-authored goal title that may well be Latin, and `%2$s`
         is `strings.percent(...)`, i.e. digits. `ו־` and `ב־` both landed on the
         far side. The `ו` now attaches to `היעד`, and `עומד על` is a
         space-separated preposition, so neither run carries a prefix. `עומד`
         and not `נמצאת` because it agrees with `היעד` (m.), which is also the
         only word here whose gender is knowable — the title's is not. -->
    <string name="gp_widget_effort_lead">והיעד %1$s עומד על %2$s.</string>
    <string name="gp_widget_effort_small">מדורג לפי דקות</string>
    <string name="gp_widget_effort_large">מדורג לפי דקות — הכמות היחידה שהאפליקציה רשאית לדרג.</string>

